  "html": "<p><b>The themes of the Vergrim's Vexation quests center around the <i>Fade Futuristic Festivities</i> as well as searching for fish to feed <a href=\"/wiki/Audrey_the_Alchemist\" title=\"Audrey the Alchemist\">Audrey's</a> cats.  In additon you can collect Singing Swords, and seek out Rattle Tooth's Family Friends.</b>\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 8 subcategories to this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Audit_Vergrim's_Quests\" title=\"Category:Audit Vergrim's Quests\">Audit Vergrim's Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>E</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Exploring_Vergrim's_Vexation_Quests\" title=\"Category:Exploring Vergrim's Vexation Quests\">Exploring Vergrim's Vexation Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Fade_Futuristic_Festivities_Quests\" title=\"Category:Fade Futuristic Festivities Quests\">Fade Futuristic Festivities Quests</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Fish_Farming\" title=\"Category:Fish Farming\">Fish Farming</a></li></ul>\n<h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Rattle_Family_Friends_Series\" title=\"Category:Rattle Family Friends Series\">Rattle Family Friends Series</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Singing_Swords\" title=\"Category:Singing Swords\">Singing Swords</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Skeer'ikt_the_Chirper_Quests\" title=\"Category:Skeer'ikt the Chirper Quests\">Skeer'ikt the Chirper Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>V</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Vergrim's_Fizz_Quests\" title=\"Category:Vergrim's Fizz Quests\">Vergrim's Fizz Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Vergrim's Quests\"</h2>\n<p>There are 22 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Another_Journey\" title=\"Another Jo